=== contradiction_setup ===

## KEY SCENE: Sets up the sleep contradiction
## Player can observe bags_under_eyes symptom vs "sleeping fine" claim

NARRATOR
*Gregory stifles a yawn, then immediately looks embarrassed.*

%The dark circles under his eyes are more apparent now, in the session's softer lighting.%<symptom:bags_under_eyes>

PATIENT (dismissive)
"Sorry. Long day. But I [sleep fine, really]<keyword:gregory.sleep.claims_fine>."

@pause 0.5

PATIENT (quickly)
"It's not like I'm lying awake for [hours]<keyword:gregory.sleep.minimizing>. Not every night, anyway."

%His leg bouncing intensifies briefly before he stills it with conscious effort.%<symptom:leg_bouncing>

